RESL: "NO DIAL TONE"    "No Dial Tone"  NDT
RESL: "NO DIALTONE"     "No Dial Tone"  NDT
RESL: "BUSY"            "Busy"          DIS
RESL: "NO ANSWER"       "No Answer"     DIS
RESL: "RINGING"         "Ringing"       RINGING
